{
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS": "1"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read",
      "Write",
      "Edit",
      "Glob",
      "Grep",
      "WebFetch",
      "WebSearch",
      "NotebookEdit",
      "Skill",
      "Monitor",
      "SendMessage",
      "TaskCreate",
      "TaskUpdate",
      "TaskList",
      "TaskGet",
      "TaskOutput",
      "TaskStop",
      "AskUserQuestion",
      "PushNotification",
      "EnterPlanMode",
      "ExitPlanMode",
      "ScheduleWakeup",
      "ToolSearch"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "CronCreate",
      "CronDelete",
      "CronList",
      "RemoteTrigger",
      "TeamCreate",
      "TeamDelete",
      "EnterWorktree",
      "ExitWorktree"
    ],
    "defaultMode": "auto"
  },
  "model": "opus",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/session-start.js",
            "timeout": 10000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/task-router.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/rules-loader.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/careful-guard.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/fix-depth-check.js",
            "timeout": 3000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/freeze-guard.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-escalate.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/suggest-compact.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/auto-model.js",
            "timeout": 3000
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/post-edit-light.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/ssot-source-guard.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/post-edit-format.js",
            "timeout": 10000,
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/post-edit-typecheck.js",
            "timeout": 10000,
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/drift-detector.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/fault-hint.js",
            "timeout": 5000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/lesson-nudge.js",
            "timeout": 8000
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/periodic-memory.js",
            "timeout": 10000
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/user-prompt-classify.js",
            "timeout": 3000
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-compact.js",
            "timeout": 10000
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/stop-summary.js",
            "timeout": 15000,
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/cost-tracker.js",
            "timeout": 5000,
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/shared-state-sync.js",
            "timeout": 10000,
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node ~/.claude/scripts/hooks/session-end.js",
            "timeout": 15000,
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "discord@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "telegram@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "design@knowledge-work-plugins": true,
    "codex@openai-codex": true,
    "rust-analyzer-lsp@claude-plugins-official": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "knowledge-work-plugins": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins"
      }
    },
    "openai-codex": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "openai/codex-plugin-cc"
      }
    }
  },
  "effortLevel": "high",
  "skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "skipWorkflowUsageWarning": true,
  "theme": "dark",
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(cargo test:*) on the Linux prod host — CLAUDE.md states debug-profile builds/tests are forbidden there except with explicit per-session user authorization",
      "Bash(rm -rf target/debug*) — shared cargo target dir is reused across worktrees/sessions per CLAUDE.md Quick Start warning; accidental deletion breaks other sessions",
      "Bash(git push --force*) to origin `ailin546/celue` main — repo feeds a live production trading deployment"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: Private — `ailin546/celue` (github.com)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: Encrypted local DB (`celue-main/mm/data/cchft.db`), decrypted at runtime via `CCHFT_MASTER_PASSWORD` / `~/.cchft-secret`; real exchange API keys never in repo files (per CLAUDE.md §3.7 and .env.example)",
      "**Default / protected branches**: Default branch `main`; no branch protection rules or rulesets listed by gh (protection status not confirmed — treat `main` as sensitive by convention)",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (`ailin546/celue` on github.com) and its remote(s) only — no additional orgs configured",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: `.env`, `.env.local`, `.env.*.local`, `*.key`, `api_keys*`, `secrets*`, `credentials*` (gitignored); exchange API keys, worker/master tokens, and `CCHFT_MASTER_PASSWORD` per CLAUDE.md §3.7 — share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment; also the Linux prod trading machine referenced in CLAUDE.md (live trading host, real funds — $100M scale)",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic (also note: this repo's own `main` branch feeds a live production trading deployment per CLAUDE.md deploy instructions)",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (quantitative crypto trading platform)",
      "**Trusted repo**: `~/celue` (working directory) and its remote `github.com/ailin546/celue` (private) — confidential material (non-secret) is fine to commit here; secrets/credentials are never cleared into it regardless of visibility",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "routine under `~/celue/` prefix: cargo build/check/test, npm/vite, restart.sh, deploy.sh, and other repo-local operational scripts described in CLAUDE.md are routine dev/ops actions scoped to this repo and its Linux prod counterpart"
    ]
  }
}
